(7391385, 1159664, 46918, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club...<br/> <br/>This is a nice shot. Or do I need to say two shots. I really do like this. As mentioned below there are some dust specs. But to be honest I probably would not have noticed them on my own. They are pretty minor. I can see the line slightly but as you pointed out, you left that intentionally. Also that doesn''t bother me. The skyline is nice and the flower is nice. Good job. Happy shooting.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club... This is a nice shot. Or do I need to say two shots. I really do like this. As mentioned below there are some dust specs. But to be honest I probably would not have noticed them on my own. They are pretty minor. I can see the line slightly but as you pointed out, you left that intentionally. Also that doesn''t bother me. The skyline is nice and the flower is nice. Good job. Happy shooting.', '2015-07-22 16:03:19.000000', NULL, 0),
